      "expected": "The specification does not describe a user-accessible screw terminal on the GPIO1 heater-control net. J11 is specified as the barrel-jack power input, and the heater output connector is the TPS1H200 OUT net (J4 in this netlist). A GPIO output should not be brought out to a screw terminal referenced to GND.",
